                    },
                    "input": {
                      "ticket_id": "42",
                      "body": "Hi there!\n\nI'm sorry you're experiencing issues with your password reset link. This is typically caused by the link expiring - our password reset links are valid for one hour for security purposes.\n\n**Here's how to resolve this:**\n\n1. Go to Settings > Security in your account\n2. Click \"Reset Password\" to request a fresh reset link\n3. Check your email inbox (and spam folder just in case)\n4. Click the new link within one hour to complete your password reset\n\n**Important tips:**\n- Make sure you're using the most recent reset email if you've requested multiple links\n- The link can only be used once, so if you've already clicked it, you'll need a new one\n- Password reset is currently available on the web only (not through our mobile app)\n\n**Going forward, you might want to consider:**\n- Setting up two-factor authentication (2FA) for enhanced account security\n- Using a password manager to securely store your credentials\n- If you're on a team plan, ask your admin about single sign-on (SSO) options available on our premium tiers - this eliminates the need to remember passwords altogether!\n\nIf you continue to experience issues after requesting a fresh reset link, please let me know and I'll escalate this to our technical team immediately.\n\nBest regards"
                    },
                    "name": "post_reply",
                    "type": "tool_use"
                  }
                ],
